  "Eaton, F.M. (1950). Significance of carbonates in irrigation waters. Soil Science 69 (RSC).": "Eaton, F.M. (1950). Significance of carbonates in irrigation waters. Soil Science 69 (RSC).",
  "Ebro vadisi: yarı kurak, kuru ve rüzgârlı (cierzo); yaz ETo yüksek, sulama sık.": "Valle del Ebro: semiárido, seco y ventoso (cierzo); ETo estival alta y riegos frecuentes.",
